   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The linear function <span data-math=\"f(x)=x\">f(x)=x</span> has a vertical stretch of 3, a vertical reflection, and a vertical shift down 4. Which of the following is the new function?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1224392,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=-3x-4\">f(x)=-3x-4</span>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1224391,
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"f(x)=3x-4\">f(x)=3x-4</span>"
    },
    {
